# Zwift Video Cache - CDN Domain Configuration
#
# Add one domain per line. These are the CDN domains that serve
# Zwift Video streaming content. Use zwift_video_capture.py to
# discover the actual domains used by your Zwift client.
#
# Likely candidates (verify with capture tool before enabling):
# video.zwift.com
# media.zwift.com
# zwift-video.akamaized.net
# d1xxxxxxxxx.cloudfront.net
#
# After adding domains:
# 1. Copy this file to video_cache_domains.txt (remove .example)
# 2. Create an empty file: video-cache.txt (to enable caching)
# 3. Restart zwift-offline
